Functional Requirements
Room Management
FR-01: The system shall allow the user to add a new room.
FR-02: The system shall allow the user to view all rooms.
FR-03: The system shall allow the user to search for a room by ID.
Guest Management
FR-04: The system shall allow the user to add a new guest.
FR-05: The system shall allow the user to view all guests.
FR-06: The system shall allow the user to search for a guest by ID.
Reservation Management
FR-07: The system shall allow the user to create a reservation for an available room.
FR-08: The system shall allow the user to cancel an existing reservation and mark the room as available.
FR-09: The system shall allow the user to view all reservations.
